==Battleground==
*1 [[Shin Godzilla]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
If you have high enough levels, you can easily rush this stage with both [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] just like [[God of Destruction (Merciless)|another collaboration stage]].

Another way to do it is if your [[Cat Base]] has high enough HP to where it can withstand an attack from Godzilla. (An HP setting that works is if the Cat Base has 120k or higher.) This way, when Godzilla attacks, Awakened Bahamut Cat can get a second attack in, killing the beast.

